rship, the cousins master the art of passport forgery, getting high-profile clients. Later, when a rookie mistake exposes their game, it opens the door to the criminal underworld.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/izzyxVwcLW87R4OzBdlhs9v35R4.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYXNhcmdvZCUyMEVtYmFzc3klMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The Trap","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-03-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Azi and Chemmu work tirelessly under Dammanna, but their newfound wealth pushes Razak Mama to ask for a seat at the table. On the other hand, the NIA gets closer to Dammanna.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eUIeqzgw1N2lflPZGoWuzLmbvSc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYXNhcmdvZCUyMEVtYmFzc3klMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Upgrade and Disruption","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-03-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A high-end client leads the cousins to Dammanna, the kingpin of counterfeiting, who upgrades their street-level setup to a high-tech fortress. However, the larger their business, the higher the risks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8gOMDxdEHxvehG9xHfWxx64cv50.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYXNhcmdvZCUyMEVtYmFzc3klMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"House of Cards","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-03-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The NBI strikes gold as they capture Roy, sending Dammanna into a frenzied burn-notice operation to erase all evidence. Meanwhile, the lives of the boys are left dangling amidst a national crisis.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7H3PWrOP1p3R9FfFqzpHjTdljIg.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYXNhcmdvZCUyMEVtYmFzc3klMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Two Separate Ways","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2026-03-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Dammanna outsmarts his riv